  id: DOC_1921_BangDong
  title: "\u1EA2nh gia t\u1ED9c Blackwood"
  titleEn: Blackwood Family Portrait
  year: 0
  body: "\u1EA2nh ch\u1EE5p to\xE0n gia t\u1ED9c tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\u1EC1n s\u1EA3nh
    c\xF2n d\u1EF1ng gi\xE0n gi\xE1o.\nD\xF2ng ch\u1EEF m\u1EA1 v\xE0ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi
    khung:\n\n\"BLACKWOOD MANOR \u2014 KH\u1EDEI D\u1EF0NG N\u0102M 1921\nLord Arthur
    Blackwood c\xF9ng gia quy\u1EBFn.\""
  bodyEn: "The whole family posed before an unfinished fa\xE7ade, scaffolding still
    up.\nGilt lettering beneath the frame:\n\n\"BLACKWOOD MANOR \u2014 FOUNDED 1921\nLord
    Arthur Blackwood and household.\""
  serif: 1
  flagOnRead: 0
